gact(){return"This permanently deletes:\n\xb7 Your Claras account (and the linked email, if any)\n\xb7 The groups you created with this account, for ALL of their members, with their receipt photos\n\xb7 Your membership in groups others shared with you\n\xb7 Your key and QR in the cloud, and what you shared with \u201cHelp improve Claras\u201d\n\xb7 Your groups, contacts, name, Bre-B key and photos on this phone\n\nPhotos you added to other people's groups stay with those groups, like your expenses, and their history shows you as \u201cSomeone who's no longer here\u201d. This can't be undone. If you bought Claras Pro, the purchase stays with your Google Play account."},
